<title>CANADA: Gardiner recommends Poco offer.</title>
<headline>Gardiner recommends Poco offer.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of directors of Gardiner Oil &amp; Gas Ltd on Thursday recommended that shareholders accept a takeover bid by Poco Petroleums Ltd.</p>
<p>Gardiner said that Poco's offer to purchase all outstanding common shares of Gardiner for C$5 plus 0.6 of a Poco common share was found to be fair by an independent committee..</p>
<p>The Poco offer expires Oct 9, 1996 and is conditional upon at least 90 percent of the issued and outstanding Gardiner shares being tendered to the offer. It values Gardiner at about C$225 million. Poco had a lock-up deal with shareholders accounting for about 73 percent of Gardiner's shares.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
</text>
